#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint
msgid "Constraint modifying the transformation of objects and bones"
msgstr "Begränsning som modifierar transformationen av objekt och ben"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.active
msgid "Constraint is the one being edited"
msgstr "Begränsningen är den som redigeras"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.enabled
msgid "Use the results of this constraint"
msgstr "Använd resultaten av denna begränsning"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.error_location
msgid "Lin error"
msgstr "Linjärt fel"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.error_location
msgid ""
"Amount of residual error in Blender space unit for constraints that work on "
"position"
msgstr ""
"Mängd kvarstående fel i Blenders rymdenhet för begränsningar som fungerar på "
"position"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.error_rotation
msgid "Rotation error"
msgstr "Rotationsfel"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.error_rotation
msgid ""
"Amount of residual error in radians for constraints that work on orientation"
msgstr ""
"Mängden kvarstående fel i radianer för begränsningar som arbetar med "
"orientering"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.influence
msgid "Amount of influence constraint will have on the final solution"
msgstr ""
"Hur stor påverkan begränsningen kommer att ha på den slutliga lösningen"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.is_override_data
msgid "Override Constraint"
msgstr "Åsidosätt begränsning"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.is_override_data
msgid ""
"In a local override object, whether this constraint comes from the linked "
"reference object, or is local to the override"
msgstr ""
"I ett objekt med lokal biblioteksöverskrivning anger detta om begränsningen "
"kommer från det länkade referensobjektet eller är lokal för överskrivningen"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.is_valid
msgid "Constraint has valid settings and can be evaluated"
msgstr "Begränsningen har giltiga inställningar och kan utvärderas"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.mute
#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_channels_editable_toggle.mode:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_channels_setting_disable.mode:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_channels_setting_enable.mode:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.ANIM_OT_channels_setting_toggle.mode:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.CLIP_OT_disable_markers.action:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.CLIP_OT_graph_disable_markers.action:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.MESH_OT_select_mode.action:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.OUTLINER_OT_constraint_operation.type:'DISABLE'
#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_context_collection_boolean_set.type:'DISABLE'
msgid "Disable"
msgstr "Inaktivera"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.mute
msgid "Enable/Disable Constraint"
msgstr "Aktivera/inaktivera begränsning"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.name
msgid "Constraint name"
msgstr "Namn på begränsning"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space
msgid "Owner Space"
msgstr "Ägarkoordinatsystem"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space
msgid "Space that owner is evaluated in"
msgstr "Koordinatsystemet som ägaren utvärderas i"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'WORLD'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'WORLD'
msgid "The constraint is applied relative to the world coordinate system"
msgstr "Begränsningen tillämpas i förhållande till världskoordinatsystemet"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'CUSTOM'
#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'CUSTOM'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'CUSTOM'
msgid "Custom Space"
msgstr "Anpassat koordinatsystem"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'CUSTOM'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'CUSTOM'
msgid ""
"The constraint is applied in local space of a custom object/bone/vertex group"
msgstr ""
"Begränsningen tillämpas i det lokala koordinatsystemet för ett anpassat "
"objekt, ben eller en hörnpunktsgrupp"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'POSE'
#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'POSE'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'POSE'
msgid "Pose Space"
msgstr "Poseringsrymd"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'POSE'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'POSE'
msgid ""
"The constraint is applied in Pose Space, the object transformation is ignored"
msgstr ""
"Begränsningen tillämpas i poseringsrymden; objektets transformation ignoreras"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
msgid "Local With Parent"
msgstr "Lokal med överordnad"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
msgid ""
"The constraint is applied relative to the rest pose local coordinate system "
"of the bone, thus including the parent-induced transformation"
msgstr ""
"Begränsningen tillämpas i förhållande till benets lokala koordinatsystem för "
"vilopositionen och inkluderar därmed transformationen som orsakats av det "
"överordnade benet"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'LOCAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'LOCAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.DriverTarget.transform_space:'LOCAL_SPACE'
#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilWeightAngleModifier.space:'LOCAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.ActionSlot.target_space:'LOCAL'
#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_rotate_instances.cc:23
#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_scale_instances.cc:24
#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_translate_instances.cc:22
msgid "Local Space"
msgstr "Lokal rymd"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.owner_space:'LOCAL'
#. :src: bpy.types.ShrinkwrapConstraint.project_axis_space:'LOCAL'
msgid ""
"The constraint is applied relative to the local coordinate system of the "
"object"
msgstr ""
"Begränsningen tillämpas i förhållande till objektets lokala koordinatsystem"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.show_expanded
msgid "Constraint's panel is expanded in UI"
msgstr "Begränsningens panel är utfälld i användargränssnittet"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.space_object
msgid "Object for Custom Space"
msgstr "Objekt för anpassat koordinatsystem"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.space_subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ChildOfConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyLocationConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyRotationConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyScaleConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.DampedTrackConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.FloorConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.KinematicConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.LimitDistanceConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.LockedTrackConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.PivotConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.StretchToConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.TrackToConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.TransformConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ConstraintTarget.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ConstraintTargetBone.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilHookModifier.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.HookModifier.subtarget
msgid "Sub-Target"
msgstr "Delmål"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.space_subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ActionConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ChildOfConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyLocationConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyRotationConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyScaleConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.CopyTransformsConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.DampedTrackConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.FloorConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.KinematicConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.LimitDistanceConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.LockedTrackConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.StretchToConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.TrackToConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.TransformConstraint.subtarget
#. :src: bpy.types.ConstraintTarget.subtarget
msgid "Armature bone, mesh or lattice vertex group, ..."
msgstr "Armaturben, mesh- eller gitterhörnpunktsgrupp, ..."

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space
msgid "Space that target is evaluated in"
msgstr "Koordinatsystemet som målet utvärderas i"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'WORLD'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target is evaluated relative to the world "
"coordinate system"
msgstr ""
"Målets transformation utvärderas i förhållande till världskoordinatsystemet"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'CUSTOM'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target is evaluated relative to a custom object/"
"bone/vertex group"
msgstr ""
"Målets transformation utvärderas i förhållande till en anpassad objekt-/ben-/"
"vertexgrupp"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'POSE'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target is only evaluated in the Pose Space, the "
"target armature object transformation is ignored"
msgstr ""
"Transformationen av målet utvärderas endast i poseringsrymden; "
"transformationen av målets armatur-objekt ignoreras"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL_WITH_PARENT'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target bone is evaluated relative to its rest pose "
"local coordinate system, thus including the parent-induced transformation"
msgstr ""
"Transformationen av målbenet utvärderas i förhållande till dess lokala "
"koordinatsystem för vilopositionen, vilket inkluderar transformationen som "
"orsakats av det överordnade benet"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target is evaluated relative to its local "
"coordinate system"
msgstr ""
"Målets transformation utvärderas i förhållande till dess lokala "
"koordinatsystem"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL_OWNER_ORIENT'
msgid "Local Space (Owner Orientation)"
msgstr "Lokal rymd (ägarorientering)"

#. :src: bpy.types.Constraint.target_space:'LOCAL_OWNER_ORIENT'
msgid ""
"The transformation of the target bone is evaluated relative to its local "
"coordinate system, followed by a correction for the difference in target and "
"owner rest pose orientations. When applied as local transform to the owner "
"produces the same global motion as the target if the parents are still in "
"rest pose."
msgstr ""
"Transformationen av målbenet utvärderas i förhållande till dess lokala "
"koordinatsystem, följt av en korrigering för skillnaden i målets och ägarens "
"orientering i viloposition. När den tillämpas som lokal transformation på "
"ägaren ger den samma globala rörelse som målet om föräldrarna fortfarande är "
"i viloposition."

